      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 2,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I can tell just by looking at you that you’re a\nstrong Pokémon Trainer.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕţ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 176,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 76
    },
    {
      "displayText": "To defeat a Trainer like you, it’s necessary to go all\nin on a single strategy!<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nSo I’ll be attacking you with my favorite of all\nPokémon types: the Bug type!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕţ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 328,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 165
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Being dedicated to a single thing you love forces\nyou to be creative to overcome its weaknesses,<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nand that creativity leads to true strength!<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nYou should battle me and see for yourself!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕţ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 660,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 194
    },
    {
      "displayText": "If you care for a battle, ready yourself and then say\nthe word!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕţ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 1048,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0049006600200079006F00750020006300610072006500200066006F00720020006100200062006100740074006C0065002C00200072006500610064007900200079006F0075007200730065006C006600200061006E00640020007400680065006E0020007300610079000A00740068006500200077006F00720064002100100002011401630000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 68
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0005>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 1184,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00050000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Come on! Battle me and my Bug-type Pokémon!\nPlease?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕţ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 1196,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0043006F006D00650020006F006E002100200042006100740074006C00650020006D006500200061006E00640020006D00790020004200750067002D007400790070006500200050006F006B00E9006D006F006E0021000A0050006C0065006100730065003F00100002011401630000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 56
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I’ll battle you",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 1308,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00492019006C006C00200062006100740074006C006500200079006F00750000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 16
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Nah, I’m good",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 1340,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004E00610068002C002000492019006D00200067006F006F00640000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 14
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Whaaat? C’mon! Bug types have so many\nweaknesses you can exploit—Fire, Rock, Flying...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕţ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 1368,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 91
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Just to warn you, I’ll be using Mega Evolution to\ndraw out the potential of my beloved bugs!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕţ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 1552,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 97
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+000B>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 1748,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Good work out there, team—especially Pinsir!\nGreat job with that Mega Evolution!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕţ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 1760,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 85
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Seems like more and more Trainers are using\nMega Evolution lately, huh?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕţ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 1932,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 76
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I’ve heard rumors—though they’re just rumors,\nmind you—that some shady character taught<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nQuasartico how to make Mega Rings.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nApparently, that person’s name is...AZ.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕţ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 2084,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 173
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Wow, I never would’ve known!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 2432,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0057006F0077002C002000490020006E006500760065007200200077006F0075006C00642019007600650020006B006E006F0077006E00210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Boy, what an interesting rumor",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 2492,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0042006F0079002C0020007700680061007400200061006E00200069006E0074006500720065007300740069006E0067002000720075006D006F00720000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "The story goes that this AZ person traveled all the\nway to some far-off region called Hoenn.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nThere, he researched the origins of Mega\nEvolution to satisfy his own curiosity.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕţ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 2556,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 181
    },
    {
      "displayText": "It seems he shared his research with Quasartico.\nBut what does he hope to achieve?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕţ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 2920,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 87
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I guess I’ve got no complaints as long as I can\nMega Evolve my beloved Pokémon!<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nWe should all just appreciate this precious gift\nthat we have.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕţ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
